    "snowbird": {
      "status": "ok",
      "resort": "Snowbird",
      "adapter": "powdr",
      "updatedAt": "2026-04-16 05:42:20",
      "note": "Gooooood morning Snowbird! It’s Owen, with your snow report for Thursday. It's happening. Everybody stay calm, we’ve got snow in the forecast people. Starting at around 9am, it’s looking like a 90% chance of precipitation with 3-5” forecasted throughout the day. We’ll have a high of 39° around 11 am, which should then drop to 30° throughout the remainder of the day. With slightly colder temperatures today, I'd rock a shell, but you won't need to go crazy with the mid and base layers. The existing snow might be skiing a bit firmer until the new snow starts falling, which makes for a great day to demo some skis in different conditions. So if you haven’t, go check out the Blister Summit and convice yourself to buy a pair of skis that you probably don't need. Make sure to stick around for the weekend (especially if you're visiting for Blister) as we've got everybodies favorite week of Plazapalooza coming up. Yeah, that's right, it's Electronic Music Weekend . *Insert DJ airhorn noises here.* We've got some sick DJs that'll be out on the Plaza Deck, including Apoll, FleetmacWood, SkiiTour and more. It's going to be a great time, so don't miss out! As a reminder, we have closed Chickadee Bowl for construction on a new lift. Please stay out of that area for the foreseeable future as getting smacked by a construction vehicle or falling in a ditch would not make for a great day. If you normally park at the top of Chickadee, the bypass road just further down Entry 4 makes for a good parking alternative. ALL uphill travel is closed. Don’t be that guy (or gal). Please remember to ski and ride in control, if you don’t, you’re gonna have a bad time. It's Surf Season at The Bird, so to quote that one surfer guy, \"drop in, just smack the lip, wapow.\" Go get pitted today. #GMTB",
